    {
      "text": "Grouped bar chart of DTPcv 3rd dose and 1st dose coverage (%) for nine districts and the national level, sorted by 3rd-dose coverage. Labelled values range from 67.2 (District 6, 3rd dose) to 93.8 (District 9); in most districts the 1st-dose bar is taller than the 3rd-dose bar, but in District 9 the 3rd-dose bar is taller.",
